  "description": "A powerful cross-platform performance monitoring and debugging tool for Blazor applications (Server, WebAssembly, SSR) that helps identify unnecessary re-renders and optimize component performance. Features automatic environment detection, browser console logging, and comprehensive tracking. Inspired by the React why-did-you-render library.",
