  "releaseNotes": "Major feature release: Added advanced state tracking system with field-level change detection. New: [TrackState], [IgnoreState], [StateTrackingOptions] attributes; startup optimization with cache pre-warming; 13+ new configuration options; thread-safe state tracking. Enhanced: Real-time component monitoring, automated cleanup, performance tuning controls. License: Changed to LGPL v3 for commercial compatibility. See CHANGELOG.md for full details.",
